sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RGB as Delayed RGB/Base Stream
  participant GRAY as Gray8/Mask Stream
  participant DUT as AXI_FrameCompositor
  participant OUT as Output AXI Stream

  GRAY->>DUT: mask beat (gray8 + SOF/EOL)
  RGB->>DUT: base beat (RGB + SOF/EOL)

  alt overlay_zeros = 1
    DUT->>OUT: emit binary mask color (edge->white, else black)
  else overlay_zeros = 0
    DUT->>OUT: emit base RGB with edge overlay color
  end

  alt selected delay tap not prefilling yet
    DUT-->>GRAY: gray READY gated until selected base tap valid
    DUT-->>RGB: base READY asserted for prefill progression
  else tap valid
    DUT->>OUT: lockstep output on accepted gray beat
  end

  Note over DUT,OUT: In merge mode, SOF/EOL follow gray timing while delayed base alignment is enforced.
